ammen, Norway`,subtitle:`Helping Ukrainians integrate and thrive in Norway through community, education, and support. We are based in Drammen and surrounding areas.`,become:`Become a Member`,learn:`Learn More`,seoTitle:`Home`,seoDescription:`Mrija connects Ukrainians in Drammen through education, events, volunteering, and practical support.`,statsMembers:`MEMBERS`,statsEvents:`EVENTS`,statsSupport:`Years OF SUPPORT`,galleryCtaTitle:`Want to be part of our next event?`,galleryCtaDesc:`Join our community of volunteers and start making a difference today. Every helping hand brings us closer to a better world.`,galleryCtaVolBtn:`Become a Volunteer`,galleryCtaEventsBtn:`Upcoming Events`,aboutHeroHover:`MriJa volunteers`},He={community:`Community Events`,title:`Upcoming Events`,subtitle:`Connect with fellow Ukrainians and build lasting friendships`,h2:`New events coming soon`,button:`Register now`,comingSoon:`Coming Soon`,allEventsTitle:`All Upcoming Events`,allEventsSubtitle:`Browse and register for upcoming community events`,filters:{ariaLabel:`Event filters`,searchLabel:`Search`,searchPlaceholder:`Search by title or topic`,typeLabel:`Type`,allTypes:`All types`,languageLabel:`Language`,allLanguages:`All languages`,sortLabel:`Sort`,newest:`Newest first`,oldest:`Oldest first`,resultCount:`{{visible}} of {{total}} events`,registrationOpen:`Registration open`,noMatches:`No events match these filters.`},memories:`Memories`,pastEventsTitle:`Past Events`,pastEventsSubtitle:`Take a look at our recent community gatherings`,culturalEvening:{day:`Every Friday`,time:`18:00 - 21:00`,name:`Cultural Evening`,description:`Join us for traditional Ukrainian music, food, and fellowship`},easterEvent:{name:`Ukrainian Easter`,day:`April 12`,description:`Join us for a traditional Ukrainian Easter celebration with the community.`},ivanKupalaEvent:{name:`St. John's Eve`,day:`June 20`,description:`Traditional celebration with flower wreaths and bonfires.`},annualReportEvent:{name:`Annual General Meeting`,day:`March 15`,description:`Summarizing our work for the past year and sharing plans for the future.`},karaokeEvent:{name:`Karaoke +`,day:`April 24`,description:`Joy of songs and bonding with the community.`},poetryEvent:{name:`Literature Evening`,day:`April 14`,description:`With literary critic Marina Hobbel.`},tags:{annual:`Annual Event`,regular:`Regular Event`},retroRoomEvent:{name:`Literature Evening`,day:`May 20`,description:`Theme: "What is called home".`},teachersForumEvent:{name:`Teachers Forum`,day:`March 22`,description:`To create networks for Ukrainian teachers.`},past:{title:`Past Events`,subtitle:`Celebrating the lives we've touched and the vibrant communities we've built together. Each photo tells a story of hope, resilience, and collective action.`,viewGallery:`View Gallery Archive`,tags:{annual:`Annual Highlight`,education:`Education`,culture:`Culture`,literature:`Literature`,community:`Community`,meeting:`Meeting`},events:{julebord:{title:`Ukrainian Winter Gathering`,desc:`Our biggest community event of the year brought together over 500 supporters, celebrating our resilience and unity in Norway.`},teachers:{title:`Ukrainian Teachers Forum`,desc:`A dedicated networking and idea-sharing event empowering Ukrainian educators to integrate and thrive.`},kupala:{title:`Ivana Kupala Festival`,desc:`Traditional Ukrainian midsummer celebration preserving our rich cultural heritage with music and flower wreaths.`},poetry:{title:`Ukrainian Poetry Evening`,desc:`A cozy gathering deeply connecting our community through classic and modern Ukrainian literature.`},independence:{title:`Independence Day Celebration`,desc:`A vibrant celebration of freedom and identity with hundreds gathering in traditional embroidery.`},annualReport:{title:`Annual General Meeting`,desc:`Summarizing our work for the past year and sharing plans for the future.`}},stats:{events:`Total Events`,volunteers:`Association Members`,impacted:`Lives Impacted`},cta:{title:`Want to be part of our next event?`,desc:`Join our community of volunteers and start making a difference today. Every helping hand brings us closer to a better world.`,volunteer:`Become a Volunteer`,upcoming:`Upcoming Events`}}},Ue={education:`Education & Integration`,title:`Our Courses`,subtitle:`Learn, grow, and integrate into Norwegian society`,enroll:`How to join`,howToJoin:`How to join`,joinPhoneCta:`Call {{phone}}`,joinTelegramCta:`Telegram`,joinFallbackCta:`Contact us for practical details about joining this course.`,digitalVerden:{levels:`Support`,duration:`Saturday 11:00–12:30`,name:`Digital World`,description:`Everything from a translator to anything you need help with.`,teacherName:`Sviatoslav`,teacherInfo:`Digital literacy and IT specialist.`},phoneLabel:`Phone`,norskKursA1:{levels:`A1`,duration:`Saturday 12:30–14:00`,name:`Norwegian Course A1`,description:`Language course for beginners`,teacherName:`Volodymyr Vasiuta`,teacherInfo:`Experienced Norwegian teacher for beginners.`},norskKursB1:{levels:`B1`,duration:`Tuesday 11:00–13:00`,name:`Norwegian Course B1`,description:`Language course for intermediate level`,teacherName:`Valentyna Bilobotska`,teacherInfo:`Philologist, course organizer.`},yogaCourse:{name:`Yoga Course`,levels:`All levels`,duration:`Every Sunday 18:30–20:00`,description:`Yoga classes for physical and mental well-being.`,teacherName:`Maria Naplekova`,teacherInfo:`Certified yoga instructor.`},moreInfo:`More Info`,adults:`Adults`,level:`Level`,duration:`Duration`,locationLabel:`Location`,drammenLibrary:`2nd floor, Drammen Library`,locationDrammenLibB1:`2nd floor, Drammen Library + various locations`,knutepunktStromso:`Knutepunkt Strømsø, Telthusgata 8, 3044 Drammen`,locationGuideLabel:`How to find us`,drammenLibraryGuideTitle:`Drammen Library`,drammenLibraryGuideDescription:`The course takes place on the 2nd floor of Drammen Library. Use the main entrance and follow the signs or course host to the room.`,locationMainEntranceCaption:`Main entrance`,loca