entTerms:`Confirm membership registration.`},paymentEyebrow:`Membership payment`,paymentCompleteTitle:`Membership confirmed`,paymentCompleteDescription:`Your Vipps payment is captured and your membership has been registered.`,paymentPendingTitle:`Checking your Vipps payment`,paymentPendingDescription:`We are waiting for Vipps to confirm the payment and finish the membership registration.`,paymentFailedTitle:`Payment was not completed`,paymentFailedDescription:`Vipps reported that the payment was canceled, expired, or otherwise not completed.`,paymentErrorTitle:`We could not verify the payment yet`,paymentErrorDescription:`Please try again in a moment. If the payment has already gone through, it is usually enough to refresh the status.`,missingReferenceTitle:`We could not find the payment reference.`,missingReferenceDescription:`Please return to the membership section and start the Vipps payment again.`,paymentReferenceLabel:`Reference`,paymentStatusLabel:`Status`,memberNameLabel:`Name`,memberEmailLabel:`Email`,memberPhoneLabel:`Phone`,processingStatus:`Processing`,refreshStatus:`Refresh status`,backToMembership:`Back to membership`,goHome:`Go to homepage`,walletTitle:`Membership card`,walletDescription:`Add your membership QR to your phone wallet or open the verification page.`,verifyMembership:`Verify membership`,appleWallet:`Apple Wallet`,googleWallet:`Google Wallet`,storageWarning:`The payment is confirmed, but automatic saving to the registration list needs one more setup step.`,statusLoadError:`We could not verify your Vipps payment right now.`,paymentPageSeoTitle:`Membership payment`,paymentPageSeoDescription:`Follow the Vipps membership payment and registration status.`,notAvailable:`N/A`},Ge={hereForYou:`We're Here For You`,title:`Community Support`,subtitle:`Comprehensive support for your integration journey`,mentorship:`Mentorship Program`,mentorshipDesc:`Connect with experienced community members who can guide you through integration challenges, job search, and everyday life in Norway.`,findMentor:`Find a Mentor →`,housing:`Housing Assistance`,housingDesc:`Guidance on finding accommodation, understanding rental contracts, tenant rights, and connecting with other community members looking for housing.`,learnMore:`Learn More →`,jobMarket:`Job Market Support`,jobMarketDesc:`Resume workshops, interview preparation, networking events, and connections to employers looking for skilled Ukrainian professionals.`,explore:`Explore Opportunities →`,legal:`Legal & Administrative Help`,legalDesc:`Get assistance with residence permits, work permits, tax cards, and navigating Norwegian bureaucracy with our volunteer advisors.`,getHelp:`Get Help →`},Ke={stay:`Stay updated with our newsletter`,enter:`Enter your Email`,subscribe:`Subscribe`,email:`The email must contain the "@" symbol.`},qe={address:`Address`,email:`Email`,phone:`Phone`,socials:`Social Media`,home:`Home`,about:`About Us`,events:`Events`,contact:`Contact`,terms:`Bylaws`,privacy:`Privacy Policy`,rights:`© 2025 MriJa. All rights reserved`,orgName:`Ukrainian Association in Drammen and Surrounding Areas - MriJa`,orgNumber:`Org. no: 9306 56 186`},Je={moments:`Our Moments`,title:`Community Gallery`,subtitle:`Explore the vibrant moments of our Ukrainian community in Norway. From cultural celebrations to educational programs, these images capture our journey of integration and connection.`,events:{advokat:`March in Lier`,julebord3:`Winter Gathering`,pinsedag:`Pentecostal Celebration`,pinsedag2:`Pentecost Celebration`,ece8ef:`Pentecostal Concert`,julebord:`Christmas Dinner`,poezikveld1:`Poetry Evening`,demo:`February 24th Memorial`}},Ye={whatDrivesUs:`What Drives Us`,title:`Our Mission`,subtitle:`Empowering Ukrainians in Norway to thrive through community, culture, and connection`,inspire:`Inspire`,inspireDesc:`We inspire Ukrainians in Norway to embrace
their heritage while building a new life, fostering confidence and cultural pride.`,support:`Support`,supportDesc:`From language learning to legal guidance, we
provide comprehensive support for every step of the integration journey.`,connect:`Connect`,connectDesc:`We create meaningful connections between
Ukrainian families, Norwegian communities, and professional networks.`,shape:`Shape the Future`,shapeDesc:`Through education and mentorship, we prepare Ukrainian families to thrive and contribute to Norwegian society.`,narrativeTitle:`Why we do what we do`,narrativeDesc:`Every year, MriJa helps hundreds of newcomers find their footing in their new home country, while simultaneously sending critical supplies back to Ukraine. Our goal is that no one should feel alone.`,btnHistory:`Read our history`,btnBylaws:`View Bylaws`,history:{title:`Our History`,p1:`MriJa was born out of a deep love for Ukraine and an unwavering belief in freedom. Our name means "Dream" in Ukrainian, and it represents the hope we carry together with the Norwegian people for a peaceful future.`,p2:`What started as a small group of volunteers in Norway wanting to make a difference has grown into a robust organization building bridges between our two countries through humanitarian aid, cultural exchange, and political engagement.`,milestonesTitle:`Important Milestones`,m1:{year:`2023`,title:`The Beginning`,desc:`The first seeds were sown during the Revolution of Dignity. We started with the collection of necessary equipment.`},m2:{year:`2025`,title:`Mobilization`,desc:`When the invasion hit, we multiplied our efforts. Norway became a hub for logistics and support.`},m3:{year:`Now`,title:`A Living Dream`,desc:`We now run extensive aid programs and serve as a voice for Ukraine in Norwegian society.`},quote:`Together, we keep the dream of a free Ukraine alive.`,btnSupport:`Support Us`,btnClose:`Close`}},Xe={meetTheTeam:`Meet The Team`,title:`Our Leadership`,subtitle:`Dedicated volunteers working tirelessly to make Mrija Norway a welcoming home for our community`,roman:`Roman Petrenko`,romanP:`Board Member`,sviatoslav:`Sviatoslav Stanislavskyi`,sviatoslavP:`Digital Courses Lead and BM`,tetiana:`Tetiana Borysenko`,tetianaP:`Chair of the Board`,oksanaNenchina:`Oksana Nenchina`,oksanaNenchinaP:`Deputy Board Member`},Ze={wantToHost:`Want to Host an Event?`,title:`Reach out`,subtitle:`Do you have an idea for a community event? We'd love to hear from you! Contact us to discuss hosting your own event.`,name:`Name`,email:`Email`,message:`Message`,send:`Send`,emailError:`The email must contain the "@" symbol.`},Qe={communityEvents:`Community Events`,title:`Upcoming Events`,subtitle:`Join our vibrant community events and connect with fellow Ukrainians in Norway`},$e={dontMiss:`Don't Miss`,title:`Featured Event`,students:`85+ students`,h2:`Stay tuned - new events coming soon`,price:`Free`,day:`August 24, 2025`,time:`18:00 - 21:00`,name:`Ukrainian Independence Day Celebration`,description:`Join us for a grand celebration of Ukrainian Independence Day with traditional music, dance performances, food stalls, children's activities, and more!`,button:`Register Now`},et={eventTitle:`Reserve your place for`,courseTitle:`Join the waiting list for`,eventDesc:`Leave your contact details and we will save your registration in our own system. We will use them only for practical updates about this event.`,courseDesc:`Leave your contact details and we will reach out with the next practical details about this course.`,name:`Name`,surname:`Surname`,email:`Email`,phone:`Phone number`,phoneOptional:`optional`,register:`Send registration`,submitting:`Sending...`,error:`We couldn't save your registration. Please try again.`,successEventBadge:`Registration received`,successCourseBadge:`Course interest received`,successTitleEvent:`You're registered`,successTitleCourse:`We saved your interest`,successDescEvent:`Thanks for registering for {{name}}. We look forward to seeing you there.`,successDescCourse:`Thanks for your interest in {{name}}. We will get back to you with the next details.`,detailsTitle:`Registration details`,dayLabel:`Date`,timeLabel:`Time`,locationLabel:`Place`,confirmationNote:`We will contact you if anything practical changes before the event.`,emailCta:`Email us`,telegramCta:`Telegram`,membershipPrompt:`Want to support more evenings like this? Membership is the best next step.`,membershipCta:`See membership`,closeCta:`Continue browsing`},tt={badge:`LIVE AID UPDATE`,title:`Your support means everything to us.`,subtitle:`Mrija is driven by volunteering and generous contributions. Every krone goes directly to our local education programs.`,amountRaised:`TOTAL RAISED`,goal:`Goal:`,complete:`Complete`,remaining:`remaining`,trend:`+12% this week`,pendingAllocation:`NOK {{amount}} from the Pentecost celebration has been received and is awaiting allocation.`,join:`Become a member`,donateNow:`Pay with Vipps`,oneTime:`No recurring payments`,report:`See detailed report →`,card1Amount:`100,-`,card1Label:`Single Donation`,card2Amount:`500,-`,card2Label:`Most Popular`,card3Amount:`1000,-`,card3Label:`Support Grant`,feature1Title:`100% Transparent`,feature1Desc:`Every krone is tracked and reported monthly.`,feature2Title:`Direct Aid`,feature2Desc:`Funds go directly to our local programs.`,feature3Title:`2k Donors`,feature3Desc:`A growing community of global supporters.`,footer:`STAND WITH MRIJA`,cancellationTerms:`There is no binding period, and if you wish to stop your regular deduction agreement, please contact us at phone +47 912 54 807 or email mrija.i.drammen@gmail.com`},nt={badge:`LIVE TRANSPARENCY REPORT`,title:`Detailed Impact Report`,subtitle:`A comprehensive breakdown of how your contributions are providing essential support, relief, and reconstruction across Ukraine.`,totalAmountLabel:`Total Amount Raised`,updatedLabel:`UPDATED 2 HOURS AGO`,livesImpactedLabel:`Lives Directly Impacted`,activeProjectsLabel:`Active Projects`,acrossRegions:`Across 12 regions in Ukraine`,fundsDistribution:`Funds Distribution Breakdown`,militaryAidTitle:`Military Support`,militaryAidDesc:`Direct assistance to military personnel: equipment, technology, and protection.`,humanitarianAidTitle:`Humanitarian Aid`,humanitarianAidDesc:`Assistance to civilians: food, medicine, and basic necessities.`,otherOrgsTitle:`Support for Other Organizations`,otherOrgsDesc:`Collaboration with other volunteer groups for joint relief efforts.`,otherTitle:`Other`,otherTitleDesc:`Various expenses, logistics, and urgent matters not falling under fixed categories.`,impactByRegion:`Impact by Region`,kyiv:`Kyiv Oblast`,kharkiv:`Kharkiv Region`,kherson:`Kherson Oblast`,odesa:`Odesa Region`,allocated:`allocated`,viewMap:`View Interactive Map →`,recentContributions:`Partner Allocations`,contributionsDesc:`A transparent view of where our funds are actively deployed.`,thProject:`RECIPIENT/PROJECT`,thCategory:`CATEGORY`,thDate:`DATE`,thAmount:`AMOUNT`,loadMore:`Load More Allocations ↓`,togetherTitle:`Together, We Restore Hope`,togetherDesc:`Our mission is far from over. Join thousands of others in rebuilding Ukraine and providing life-saving support where it's needed most.`,startMonthly:`Start Monthly Donation`,downloadAudit:`Download Audit Report`,cancellationTerms:`There is no binding period, and if you wish to stop your regular deduction agreement, please contact us at phone +47 912 54 807 or email mrija.i.drammen@gmail.com`},rt={teamLabel:`Our Team`,title:`Meet the course team`,subtitle:`Our dedicated course leaders bring passion and expertise to every lesson, supporting your journey to new skills.`,valentina:`Valentina Belobotskaya`,valentinaRole:`Norwegian Teacher`,valentinaDesc:`Valentina is an experienced Norwegian teacher with solid language and grammar knowledge.`,valentinaLevel:`Level B1 - B2`,vladimir:`Vladimir Vasyuta`,vladimirRole:`Norwegian Teacher`,vladimirDesc:`Vladimir is a Norwegian teacher focused on helping students master language fundamentals and grammar.`,vladimirLevel:`Level A1 - A2`,maria:`Maria Naplekova`,mariaRole:`Certified Yoga Instructor`,mariaDesc:`Maria leads yoga classes focusing on both physical and mental well-being for all community members.`,mariaLevel:`All Levels`,sviatoslav:`Sviatoslav Stanislavskyi`,sviatoslavCourseRole: